{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:33be9caf2e580dd2","name":"Opportunist Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-33be9caf2e580dd2","title":"Opportunist Talent Tree","revision":20013,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:01:57Z","sha256":"e5f7ce2345b854774e401fafff8adcf69ec4bce5a6d3942e063ea0069075d1f3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20013","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Opportunist%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-33be9caf2e580dd2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Profiteers, gunrunners, and privateers can use the chaos of war to make a tidy profit, and you are no exception. Your talents allow you to make the best of a bad situation, keep your pockets filled with credits, and keep you long enough to spend them.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Advantageous Opening"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When an enemy or ally in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," rolls a Natural 1 on an attack roll, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a single target within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Retribution"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When a target moves one of your allies in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by any means, you gain a +2 insight bonus to your attack rolls against that target until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Slip By"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you damage a target, until the beginning of your next turn, you can move through that target's space. Moving through the target's space might still provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," as normal, and you must end your movement in a legal space.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Thrive on Chaos"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Advantageous Opening"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When an enemy or ally within 20 squares of you is reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", you gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to 5 + one-half your Character Level. Damage is subtracted from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," first, and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," remaining at the end of the encounter go away. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," do not stack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vindication"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Retribution"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When an enemy you have damaged is reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or moved to the bottom of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", your next attack made before the end of the encounter deals +1 die of damage.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
